   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Nelli Kane**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Sweet Blue Eyed Darling**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Ol Montana Cowboy**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Rocky Racoon**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Turmoil In Tinfoil**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2018-08-24** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 136 min; rated 4.5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls it a nice recording, but wonders whether set 2 tracks are mislabeled or a first track is missing [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Venue's blog says he plays so fast and intensely that he often snaps several strings in a single song [5]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2018-08-24**: taped by 420ninja; transferred by 420ninja; source: Sampson CO2s>Tascam DR-40 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2018-08-24 Pine Creek Lodge, Livingston, MT](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2018/09/billy-strings-2018-08-24-pine-creek.html) [6]\n- Poster by thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com: [Billy Strings - 2018-08-24 Pine Creek Lodge, Livingston, MT](https://thecurtainwithblog.blogspot.com/2018/09/billy-strings-2018-08-24-pine-creek.html) [7]",
